WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:02.200
There's someone

00:02.280 --> 00:04.000
Who can help us find evidence

00:04.080 --> 00:05.560
The son of Qing Province's governor

00:05.720 --> 00:07.120
Guo Xuan

00:11.840 --> 00:13.520
Prince of Jin saved his life

00:13.600 --> 00:14.800
He might

00:14.880 --> 00:16.880
Help us obtain Qing Province's accounts

00:17.040 --> 00:17.760
This way

00:17.840 --> 00:20.120
We can cross-check with the Ministry of Revenue's expenditures

00:20.200 --> 00:21.867
Proving there was indeed embezzlement

00:22.680 --> 00:23.280
But

00:23.360 --> 00:25.360
Even if we get the accounts

00:25.600 --> 00:26.480
Right now

00:26.560 --> 00:28.560
Who can we give them to?

00:32.680 --> 00:34.680
Vice Minister of Revenue Cao Biaozhi

00:34.760 --> 00:36.120
This person is upright

00:36.200 --> 00:37.560
In such matters

00:37.640 --> 00:39.640
He can distinguish right from wrong

00:39.840 --> 00:41.200
But right now

00:41.280 --> 00:42.600
More importantly

00:42.680 --> 00:44.680
How to delay Prince of Ning

00:45.200 --> 00:47.000
Who should we ask for help?
